<p>Hi Alice,</p>

<p>Please find attached the latest building plans for the new office space. Here's a summary of the key changes:</p>

<h2>Floor Plan Changes</h2>
<ul>
  <li>The main entrance has been moved to the south side to align with the street access.</li>
  <li>The open-plan work area has been expanded by 20%. We can now accommodate up to 60 people in the main workspace.</li>
  <li>Two new conference rooms have been added on the second floor (B2-01 and B2-02), each seating 12.</li>
  <li>The kitchen area has been redesigned with a double island layout and additional storage.</li>
  <li>A bike storage room has been added to the basement level, accessible from the rear alley.</li>
</ul>

<h2>Electrical</h2>
<ul>
  <li>All workstations will have USB-C power delivery built into the desks (15W per port, 4 ports per desk).</li>
  <li>The server room has been upgraded to support 40kW of cooling capacity.</li>
  <li>Emergency lighting has been updated to meet the latest fire safety codes.</li>
</ul>

<h2>Schedule</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Construction begins: July 1st</li>
  <li>Expected completion: September 15th</li>
  <li>Move-in date: October 1st</li>
</ul>

<p>Please review and let me know if you have any questions or requested changes. I need your sign-off by Friday so we can submit the permit application on Monday.</p>

<p>Thanks,<br>Bob</p>
</body>
